#: data/io.github.dzheremi2.lrcmake-gtk.metainfo.xml.in:9
#: data/io.github.dzheremi2.lrcmake-gtk.desktop.in:3
msgid "Sync lyrics of your loved songs"
msgstr "Sinkronkan lirik lagu-lagu favorit Anda"

#: data/io.github.dzheremi2.lrcmake-gtk.metainfo.xml.in:11
msgid ""
"Chronograph is an open-source application designed for accurately syncing "
"lyrics with audio timestamps."
msgstr ""
"Chronograph adalah aplikasi sumber terbuka yang dirancang untuk "
"menyinkronkan lirik secara akurat dengan stempel waktu audio."

#: data/io.github.dzheremi2.lrcmake-gtk.metainfo.xml.in:13
msgid ""
"You may notice that many of music players support synced lyrics which are "
"highlighted line-by-line or word-by-word while playing? This app was "
"designed to give the community an ability to be the ones who make these "
"lyrics."
msgstr ""
"Anda mungkin menyadari bahwa banyak pemutar musik mendukung lirik tersinkron "
"yang disorot baris demi baris atau kata demi kata saat diputar? Aplikasi ini "
"dirancang untuk memberi komunitas kemampuan menjadi pihak yang membuat lirik "
"tersebut."

#: data/io.github.dzheremi2.lrcmake-gtk.metainfo.xml.in:16
msgid ""
"Chronograph directly supports publishing to LRCLib. As many FOSS music "
"players use LRCLib to fetch synchronized lyrics, this integration allows "
"users to easily contribute their work back to the open-source community."
msgstr ""
"Chronograph secara langsung mendukung publikasi ke LRCLib. Karena banyak "
"pemutar musik FOSS menggunakan LRCLib untuk mengambil lirik tersinkron, "
"integrasi ini memungkinkan pengguna untuk dengan mudah menyumbangkan karya "
"mereka kembali ke komunitas sumber terbuka."

#: data/io.github.dzheremi2.lrcmake-gtk.metainfo.xml.in:19
msgid ""
"If you have a large base of music and just want to download lyrics for all "
"of it, Chronograph also supports mass lyrics downloading. It will try to "
"find lyrics for each of your track on LRClib and save it depending on your "
"settings."
msgstr ""
"Jika Anda memiliki koleksi musik yang besar dan hanya ingin mengunduh lirik "
"untuk semuanya, Chronograph juga mendukung pengunduhan lirik massal. "
"Aplikasi ini akan mencoba menemukan lirik untuk setiap trek Anda di LRClib "
"dan menyimpannya sesuai pengaturan Anda."

#: data/io.github.dzheremi2.lrcmake-gtk.metainfo.xml.in:22
msgid "Syncing Modes"
msgstr "Mode Sinkronisasi"

#: data/io.github.dzheremi2.lrcmake-gtk.metainfo.xml.in:24
msgid ""
"Line-by-Line (Primary): Here, every time you do sync action, timestamp is "
"placed for the whole line of lyrics. This is the most supported format of "
"synced lyrics."
msgstr ""
"Baris per Baris (Utama): Di sini, setiap kali Anda melakukan tindakan "
"sinkron, stempel waktu ditempatkan untuk seluruh baris lirik. Ini adalah "
"format lirik tersinkron yang paling didukung."

#: data/io.github.dzheremi2.lrcmake-gtk.metainfo.xml.in:26
msgid ""
"Word-by-Word (Advanced): Designed for true karaoke quality. It places a "
"timestamp for every single word, enabling players to animate lyrics with "
"precision."
msgstr ""
"Kata per Kata (Lanjutan): Dirancang untuk kualitas karaoke sejati. Mode ini "
"menempatkan stempel waktu untuk setiap kata, sehingga pemutar dapat "
"menganimasikan lirik dengan presisi."

